<title>BRAZIL: Paranapanema 1996 loss 79.5 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Paranapanema 1996 loss 79.5 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private mining company Paranapanema issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>				  1996			1995</p>
<p>    Consolidated loss     79.521 million	12.856 million</p>
<p>    Holding loss	    79.246 million	12.907 million</p>
<p>    Net revs		 842.847 million     142.036 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 24985412))</p>
</text>
